{"id":"n65002-1-7","stage":2,"title":"숙소 · 住处","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65002-1-7-1","ko":"여행지에서 머물 장소는 정하셨어요?","zh":"您在旅行地住的地方定下来了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여행지에서","meaning":"旅游地点，旅行地","explanation":"여행지：旅游地点，旅行地；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여행지","audio":"/audio/86532e69c59636193d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70722","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행지에서","audio":"/audio/76d9a51f3f7cabc0c1b3.mp3"}},{"text":"머물","meaning":"滞留，逗留，留","explanation":"머물다：滞留，逗留，留；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"머물다","audio":"/audio/5edffefea5e124c8a803.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15980","senseId":"1","lemma":"머물다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머물","audio":"/audio/f9bc173cd2c235f6d9a2.mp3"}},{"text":"장소는","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장소는","audio":"/audio/cc6c1eee574864c83de7.mp3"}},{"text":"정하셨어요?","meaning":"定，选定","explanation":"정하다：定，选定；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"1","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정하셨어요","audio":"/audio/b2dc9501753894c2d79d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86532e69c5963619","term":"여행지","zh":"旅游地点，旅行地","audio":"/audio/86532e69c59636193d79.mp3","entryId":"70722","definition":"去旅行的地方。","pronunciation":["여행지"]},{"id":"5edffefea5e124c8","term":"머물다","zh":"滞留，逗留，留","audio":"/audio/5edffefea5e124c8a803.mp3","entryId":"15980","definition":"中途停下或暂时住在某处。","pronunciation":["머물다"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","term":"정하다","zh":"定，选定","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3","entryId":"29767","definition":"从几个里面选一个。","pronunciation":["정ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/40da4edd840ef06a042d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65002-1-7-2","ko":"아니요. 요즘은 휴가철이라 숙소를 잡기가 어렵네요.","zh":"还没有。现在正是假期高峰期，很难找到住宿呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"휴가철이라","meaning":"休假季，休假期","explanation":"휴가철：休假季，休假期；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"휴가철","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88405","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가철","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가철이라","audio":"/audio/431c8432cf34d721df05.mp3"}},{"text":"숙소를","meaning":"住处，落脚点","explanation":"숙소：住处，落脚点；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"숙소","audio":"/audio/d1f8c8aeb195a0431285.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65002","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙소를","audio":"/audio/27e58c980fb3105cd80e.mp3"}},{"text":"잡기가","meaning":"定","explanation":"잡다：定；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"13","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡기가","audio":"/audio/a65d3c2e9ebbb2cb12e9.mp3"}},{"text":"어렵네요.","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렵네요","audio":"/audio/1e0fda47ae3181a59cc2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"009d74e588ba92a0","term":"휴가철","zh":"休假季，休假期","audio":"/audio/009d74e588ba92a0d08e.mp3","entryId":"88405","definition":"许多人度假的时间。","pronunciation":["휴가철"]},{"id":"d1f8c8aeb195a043","term":"숙소","zh":"住处，落脚点","audio":"/audio/d1f8c8aeb195a0431285.mp3","entryId":"65002","definition":"临时停留住宿的地方。","pronunciation":["숙쏘"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"定","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"决定计划、意见、日期等。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd53bdce9d3b2d77f280.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65002","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4153,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["还没有。现在正是假期高峰期，很难找到住宿呢。","我已经做了预订，但还没付款呢。","您在旅行地住的地方定下来了吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还没有。现在正是假期高峰期，很难找到住宿呢。","您在旅行地住的地方定下来了吗？","我已经做了预订，但还没付款呢。"],"answer":0}]}
